#   1. `Trig`, no `Blocker`: `raise` emits a TMS-justified `Derived`.
#   2. The host asserts `Blocker`, ending `raise`'s negated pattern and the
#      activation that justified `Derived`.
#   3. A pump with nothing new, so an unsupported fact would be permanent, as
#      `iret_12_2__no_unsupported_forever` judges it, not in flight.
assert Trig v=1
pump
assert Blocker v=1
pump
pump
